Properties:
- enable_fuses: If true, this portal requires all fuse collectibles to be placed before it activates.
- map_name: Stem name of the target .map file to load, e.g. delta_zone_01. Do not include the .map extension.
- use_round_complete_screen: If true, shows the end-of-round summary screen before loading the next map." 
[
