@PointClass size(-8.0 -8.0 -8.0, 8.0 8.0 8.0) color(204 204 204) = door_switch : "A standard wall switch with trigger. Features an omnilight reflecting toggle status (red for off, green for on when oneshot, purple for on when toggleable).

