- uid_to_invoke: The uid of the entity to invoke.
- light_energy: Brightness multiplier of status omnilight (default 1.0).
- light_range: Distance of status omnilight in meters (default 3.0).
- light_offset: Distance in meters to place the omnilight in front of the switch face (default 1.0).
- shadows: Whether the switch omnilight casts shadows (default true)." 
[
