@PointClass size(-8.0 -8.0 -8.0, 8.0 8.0 8.0) color(204 204 204) = info_particle_loop : "Continuously plays a looping particle effect at its location.

Particle Types:
0 = Sparks Wall
1 = Sparks Laser Wall
2 = Light Sparks
3 = Fire Flies
4 = Ash
5 = Smoke Ground
6 = Steam Hazard
7 = Sand Stream
8 = Sandstorm
9 = Snow
10 = Water
11 = Waterfall
12 = Portal
13 = Portal Alt
14 = Portal Squares
15 = Fire
16 = Fire Large
17 = Smoke Column
18 = Smoke Thin
19 = Smoke Big
99 = Custom Path (uses path property)

Properties:
- particle_type: Enum index selecting the particle effect (0=Sparks Wall, 1=Sparks Laser Wall, 2=Light Sparks, 3=Fire Flies, 4=Ash, 5=Smoke Ground, 6=Steam Hazard, 7=Sand Stream, 8=Sandstorm, 9=Snow, 10=Water, 11=Waterfall, 12=Portal, 13=Portal Alt, 14=Portal Squares, 15=Fire, 16=Fire Large, 17=Smoke Column, 18=Smoke Thin, 19=Smoke Big, 99=Custom Path).
- path: Optional filesystem path to a custom particle scene (overrides particle_type if set, e.g. res://scenes/particles/my_particle.tscn)." 
[
	particle_type(integer) : "Particle type: 0=Sparks Wall, 1=Sparks Laser Wall, 2=Light Sparks, 3=Fire Flies, 4=Ash, 5=Smoke Ground, 6=Steam Hazard, 7=Sand Stream, 8=Sandstorm, 9=Snow, 10=Water, 11=Waterfall, 12=Portal, 13=Portal Alt, 14=Portal Squares, 15=Fire, 16=Fire Large, 17=Smoke Column, 18=Smoke Thin, 19=Smoke Big, 99=Custom Path" : 0
	path(string) : "Optional filesystem path to a custom particle scene (overrides particle_type if set)." : ""
]

