@SolidClass color(204 204 204) = destructable_dynamic : "A dynamic destructable object. Inherits texture as pieces when destroyed.
0 = DEFAULT (anything)
1 = CHARGED MELEE ONLY
2 = GROUND SLAM ONLY
3 = DESTROY_ON_BUMP

Properties:
- destruction_mode: How this object can be destroyed: 0 = DEFAULT, 1 = CHARGED MELEE ONLY, 2 = GROUND SLAM ONLY, 3 = DESTROY_ON_BUMP
- freeze: 1 freezes this object in place until it is shot or destroyed
- no_drops: 1 disables all pickups spawning when this object is destroyed
- gib_scale: Extra multiplier on top of the automatic AABB-derived gib scale (default 1.0). Gibs already auto-scale to the object's size; use this to fine-tune further.
- uid_to_invoke: The uid of the entity to invoke when this object is destroyed." 
[
	destruction_mode(integer) : "How this object can be destroyed: 0 = DEFAULT, 1 = CHARGED MELEE ONLY, 2 = GROUND SLAM ONLY, 3 = DESTROY_ON_BUMP" : 0
	freeze(integer) : "1 freezes this object in place until it is shot or destroyed" : 0
	gib_scale(float) : "Extra multiplier on top of the automatic AABB-derived gib scale (default 1.0). Gibs already auto-scale to the object's size; use this to fine-tune further." : "1.0"
	no_drops(integer) : "1 disables all pickups from spawning when this object is destroyed" : 0
	uid_to_invoke(string) : "The uid of the entity to invoke when this object is destroyed." : ""
]

@PointClass size(-8.0 -8.0 -8.0, 8.0 8.0 8.0) color(204 204 204) = info_environment : "Creates environmental tweaks in the environment.
1=Alpha(Desert Night), 2=Bravo(Volcanic/Lava), 3=Charlie(Fractal Space), 4=Delta(Icy/Freezing), 5=Lounge(Hub)

Properties:
- environment: Environment index: 1=Alpha(Desert Night), 2=Bravo(Volcanic/Lava), 3=Charlie(Fractal Space), 4=Delta(Icy/Freezing), 5=Lounge(Hub).
- light_color: The color of the Sun/directional light.
- light_direction: The Vector3 direction angle of the directional sunlight.
- light_energy: The brightness multiplier for directional sunlight.
- random_earthquakes: Enables periodic random rolling earthquakes with camera shake and rumble.
- clouds: Spawns the procedural sky cloud layer above the map.
- celestial_body: Spawns the sun/moon in the sky.
- sky_rotation: Slowly rotates the skybox over time.
- shooting_stars: Spawns frequent distant shooting stars (and the odd fireball) across the sky.
- falling_stars: Spawns a parallax field of distant star specks slowly falling around the player.
- floating_rocks: Spawns huge distant floating rock islands that slowly drift around the map.
- volcanic_ridge: Spawns a jagged 360-degree volcanic mountain ridge terrain around the outer skybox." 
