EXPLOSION - 4 (default)
EXPLOSION_CANNON - 5
EXPLOSION_WOOD - 6
OIL_EXPLOSION - 1
EXPLOSION_BW - 35
EXPLOSION_ELECTRIC - 39
ROCK_EXPLOSION - 40

Properties:
- count: Number of explosions to spawn.
- explosion_type: Particle type ID for the explosion. See entity description for values.
- ms_delay: Delay in milliseconds between each explosion when count is greater than 1.
- uid: Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value." 
