@SolidClass color(204 204 204) = trigger_explosion_force : "A brush that sits frozen in place until triggered. On trigger, physics activates and an impulse is applied, launching it in the configured direction. Direction is randomized within a spread cone and the impulse is applied off-center for organic tumbling.

Properties:
- direction: Base direction the brush is launched. Does not need to be normalized.
- direction_spread: Max random deviation from direction in degrees. 0 = perfectly straight.
- force: Base impulse magnitude applied on trigger.
- force_variation: Fraction of force randomly added or removed (0.0 to 1.0). 0.25 = +-25%.
- uid: Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value.
- torque_scale: Magnitude of random angular impulse applied on trigger. 0 disables spin." 
[
	direction(string) : "Base direction the brush is launched. Does not need to be normalized." : "0.0 1.0 0.0"
	direction_spread(float) : "Max random deviation from direction in degrees. 0 = perfectly straight." : "20.0"
	force(float) : "Base impulse magnitude applied on trigger." : "10.0"
	force_variation(float) : "Fraction of force randomly added or removed (0.0 to 1.0). 0.25 = +-25%." : "0.25"
	uid(string) : "Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value." : "Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value."
	torque_scale(float) : "Magnitude of random angular impulse applied on trigger. 0 disables spin." : "5.0"
]

