@SolidClass color(204 204 204) = info_dangerous_fluid : "Creates a dangerous fluid hazard (acid, lava, or arctic water) that instantly kills the player.
0 = acid
1 = lava
2 = arctic

Properties:
- enable_sound: If true (default), spawns ambient wave audio for lava and arctic fluids. Set to false to disable spawning the sound node.
- fluid_type: 0 = Acid (green, faster ripples), 1 = Lava (orange, slower viscous glow), 2 = Arctic (icy blue-white, tall jagged waves).
- instant_kill: If true, touching this fluid instantly kills the player. Otherwise, it deals periodic damage.
- subdivisions: Grid resolution of the fluid surface mesh. Higher = smoother waves, more verts.
- teleport_name: Optional marker name to teleport the player on death/restart." 
[
	enable_sound(choices) : "If true (default), spawns ambient wave audio for lava and arctic fluids. Set to false to disable spawning the sound node." : 1 = 
