@PointClass size(-8.0 -8.0 -8.0, 8.0 8.0 8.0) color(204 204 204) = trigger_cpu_cluster : "Press-[E] trigger for the CPU Cluster Screen. Prompts 'Verify CPU Cluster' to launch the scrolling per-level CPU verification display, and prompts 'Open Door' to invoke uid_to_invoke once all 15 alpha-charlie CPUs are verified.

