@SolidClass color(204 204 204) = func_crystal : "Glowing crystal structure. Every brush in this entity gets a Quake-style procedural crystal shader: pixel-snapped dark-base to bright-tip gradient over the group height, flat per-face shade, the brush texture screen-blended over the top, and an animated band of light rising up the facets. Crystals are semi-translucent so you can see through them.

Properties:
- color: Crystal color (default cyan).
- glow: Glow strength (emission). 0 = no glow.
- opacity: How solid the crystal is. 0.05 = nearly invisible, 1 = opaque.
- uid: Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value." 
[
	color(color255) : "Crystal color (default cyan)." : "51 230 255"
	glow(float) : "Glow strength (emission). 0 = no glow." : "1.0"
	opacity(float) : "How solid the crystal is. 0.05 = nearly invisible, 1 = opaque." : "0.85"
	uid(string) : "Unique id for this entity. Other entities reference it by this value." : ""
]

